# Hermes scheduled automations — source of truth.
#
# Installed into root's crontab by deploy/cron/install-cron.sh, which replaces
# everything between the markers below and preserves all other crontab entries
# (Elestio backups, maintenance, watchtower). Edit HERE, then re-run the
# installer — never hand-edit the live crontab. Run after every redeploy.
#
# Times are ET via CRON_TZ. All jobs are idempotent (dry-run/force guards or
# natural dedup), so an overlapping/retried run won't double-post or double-write.
#
# SYNC DIRECTIONS ARE TIME-SEPARATED — never run `--sync-bidirectional` (it runs
# both directions in one pass, which lets a value synced one way echo straight
# back the other way). Source-of-truth governance:
#   * NowCerts owns Insureds (= EspoCRM "Accounts") AND Policies -> they flow
#     NowCerts -> EspoCRM (inbound).
#   * EspoCRM -> NowCerts writeback is NARROW and additive ONLY: fill-blank
#     account fields, Closed-Won -> minimal account STUB (no policy), Cases, and
#     account-linked Tasks. Never overwrites the AMS. This is the existing
#     `--espo-writeback` job, NOT the hub_to_nowcerts lane.
# The two directions run on different clocks, 12h apart:
#   * 02:00 ET  --sync-nowcerts    NowCerts -> EspoCRM (Insureds->Accounts +
#                                  Policies->Opportunities; enqueues, drain applies)
#   * 14:00 ET  --espo-writeback   EspoCRM -> NowCerts (fill-blank + Closed-Won
#                                  stub + Cases + account Tasks)
# (Supersedes the earlier "accounts sync deliberately excluded" note — per Lamar,
# both directions run, staggered.)
#
# >>> hermes automations (managed by deploy/cron/install-cron.sh) >>>
CRON_TZ=America/New_York
# NowCerts -> EspoCRM inbound pull — daily 2:00am ET (Insureds->Accounts;
# enqueues to outbound_sync_queue, hermes-outbound-drain applies to EspoCRM every
# 15 min). Direction A — 12h apart from the writeback.
0 2 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --sync-nowcerts >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# NowCerts -> EspoCRM policies — daily 2:10am ET, right after accounts exist.
# Upserts the EspoCRM Policy entity AND mirrors each policy into the Commission
# module (linked by policyId, deduped, idempotent). NowCerts owns Policies.
10 2 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --sync-policies >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# EspoCRM -> NowCerts writeback — daily 2:00pm ET. Direction B, narrow + additive:
# fill-blank account fields, Closed-Won -> minimal account stub, Cases, and
# account-linked Tasks. Never overwrites the AMS.
0 14 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --espo-writeback >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Outlook -> intake triage — every 30 min, 2h lookback (idempotent via Hermes Triaged category)
*/30 * * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --email-triage --email-provider ms365 --email-since-hours 2 >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Dashboard KPI history — daily 6:00am ET (Supabase dashboard_kpis, no Slack)
0 6 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --snapshot-kpis >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Renewal Loop v6 reconcile — daily 6:15am ET (#systems-check on failed writebacks)
15 6 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --renewal-reconcile >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Renewal risk reclassify — daily 7:30am ET (project_85_renewals, no Slack)
30 7 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --renewal-classify >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Revenue sentinel — Project 85 daily briefing -> #the-boss, weekdays 8:00am ET
0 8 * * 1-5 cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --revenue-sentinel >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Renewal prep-task sweep for Gretchen — weekdays 8:15am ET (creates EspoCRM Tasks)
15 8 * * 1-5 cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --renewal-sweep >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Commission audit (Revenue Integrity) — Mondays 7:00am ET -> Slack
0 7 * * 1 cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --commission-audit >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# End-of-month revenue scorecard — 1st of month 7:00am ET -> Slack
0 7 1 * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --eom-scorecard >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# Nightly CRM changelog -> #the-boss — 8:00pm ET
0 20 * * * cd /opt/rsg-hermes && docker compose run --rm hermes hermes --changelog >> /root/hermes-cron.log 2>&1
# (EspoCRM -> NowCerts writeback --espo-writeback now runs at 2:00pm ET above,
# staggered opposite the 2:00am inbound pull — no longer a separate 7:00pm job.)
# <<< hermes automations <<<
